  <item>
    <title>Vol.034 只有河南√ 电影小镇×</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f5fdfa22654730205d42e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f5fdfa22654730205d42e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 09:54:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期是在十一旅行后的记录节目，主观表述比较多，若未观看过剧目的也许会觉得无聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>只是记录下生活，如果还能帮到一些朋友在去游览时选择剧目，那就善莫大焉了~</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为最近事情比较多，装修，搬家，买家电家具，另外就是，身体和心理最近都出了点问题，所以录完大约两周才剪了出来，嗯，可能需要再休息一段时间吧，也可能等到什么时候有话题了，再试着继续……</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期就到这里，后会有期~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLABj_VaJW5KnqX8wdvtT8pOA-y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>左边：电影小镇 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;右边：天津</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoORNDfbux230m5hjIVnNEcHGkzH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>高粱地</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjr2VnT6JxpiAER8m4aCQulFP_WS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>二层人比较少，需要休息的可以直接上楼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlNPAjI4ijm_4-1KAi88a7g5VOaH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnC0MJOPM_AcK4x8npajxf63TZjr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>红庙学校</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcHH6YLv8svl8bMYdSneAQ2B3-E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>薛怀义</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1rezAUsHsaBQOKHo_S0wcSFeFf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老院子</span></p>]]></description>
