  <item>
    <title>Vol.022 社会规训不是枷锁，而是需要被审视的镜子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e3910e51d887b229f03757</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e3910e51d887b229f03757</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Mar 2025 05:44:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播： 老狗 灵休</span></p><span></span><p><span>这几年对于“女权”的讨论比比皆是，也能想到这种话题拿出来讨论一定少不了被DISS。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但这本就倾向于我们日常聊天的内容，在一个基本没什么听众的聊天里还要瞻前顾后的话，对自己的设限有点太过了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能也是变懒了，有点迷恋上deepseek做的shownote了，再偷几期懒~</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a></span></strong><span> 开场问候，主播老狗与另一位主播寒暄，提及本期主题。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a></span></strong><span> 讨论电影《哪吒》票房与艺术性争议：</span><br><span>对《哪吒》系列的评价（一、二部对比）；</span><br><span>艺术审美与商业票房的取舍；</span><br><span>配角“石矶娘娘”引发观众共鸣的现象分析。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a></span></strong><span> 东西方审美差异与社会规训：</span><br><span>白幼瘦审美与女性形象解绑；</span><br><span>镜子角色的自我肯定与喜剧效果；</span><br><span>西方丰腴美与东方畸形审美的历史对比。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a></span></strong><span> 性别议题与女性社会角色：</span><br><span>成语“东施效颦”“邯郸学步”的现代反思；</span><br><span>女性职场困境与家庭事业平衡的刻板印象；</span><br><span>媒体对女性牺牲的“赞美”争议（如王亚平案例）。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a></span></strong><span> 家庭关系与代际冲突：</span><br><span>主播分享与母亲的相处模式；</span><br><span>“妈宝男”现象与独立人格讨论；</span><br><span>社会对“母亲”角色的期待与压力。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a></span></strong><span> 文化符号与社会包容度：</span><br><span>成语“女为悦己者容”的争议；</span><br><span>女性化妆与自我认同的悖论；</span><br><span>商业如何塑造女性消费观念。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a></span></strong><span> 美的畸形化与历史批判：</span><br><span>三寸金莲、束腰等畸形审美的文化根源；</span><br><span>现代整容潮与韩国“双鄂手术”的风险；</span><br><span>社会对“异类”的排斥与包容反思。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3537">58:57</a></span></strong><span> 女性觉醒与自我定义：</span><br><span>上野千鹤子理论引发的自我反思；</span><br><span>大女主叙事与普通女性的生存现实；</span><br><span>倡导“不强求标准”的多元价值观。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3537">58:57</a>-结束</span></strong><span> 总结与下期预告：</span><br><span>主播分享家庭生活的朴实幸福感；</span><br><span>呼吁摆脱刻板印象，接纳自我选择。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownote编辑：deepseek</span></p>]]></description>
