  <item>
    <title>Vol.021 “恐惧之源”还是“重生象征”？乙巳年咋也得聊聊蛇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d2442ae924d4525a3ddf5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d2442ae924d4525a3ddf5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Mar 2025 02:50:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播： 老狗 灵休</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想过开年以后就一直忙的焦头烂额，录完的一期迟迟没有时间剪辑，终于剪辑完又没时间编辑shownote（虽然估计也没人看）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁着近期AI的热点，试了试让deepseek写shownote，好不好不好说，快是真的快啊~</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实灵休从小就怕蛇，是听到就发抖，看到绳子都能蹦开的那种，她能主动提起来聊聊这个话题，我属实也是没想到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许，是人总会长大吧，小时候害怕的东西，长大后也变成了习以为常……</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a></span></strong><span> 开场问候，主播老狗与狗夫人登场。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a></span></strong><span> 引入话题：蛇年的特殊意义与对蛇的复杂情感。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a></span></strong><span> 东西方文化中的蛇形象对比：伏羲女娲、圣经故事、希腊医学符号（蛇杖的起源）。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a></span></strong><span> 个人恐惧经历：狗夫人讲述关于蛇的噩梦，福建祖籍与蛇崇拜的关联。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a></span></strong><span> 蛇的生物学特性：变温动物习性、攻击性讨论、古人与蛇的生存博弈。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a></span></strong><span> 神话中的蛇：印度娜迦、佛教天龙八部、山海经巴蛇与相柳。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a></span></strong><span> 民间传说与禁忌：东北五仙、蛇精报恩的离奇故事。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a></span></strong><span> 蛇与生殖崇拜：DNA双螺旋的巧合、弗洛伊德心理学解读。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">45:39</a></span></strong><span> 日本八岐大蛇传说与游戏文化中的蛇元素（《拳皇》草薙剑）。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">45:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3322">55:22</a></span></strong><span> 希腊神话专场：美杜莎、赫拉克勒斯与九头蛇海德拉。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownote编辑：deepseek</span></p>]]></description>
